{"id":"scharf","lemma":"scharf","pos":"adj","rank":1431,"glosses":["sharp; able to cut (of a knife, edge)","sharp; tight (of a turn on a route)","sharp; discerning (of perception, intellect, mind)"],"ipa":"/ʃarf/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fe/De-scharf.ogg/De-scharf.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"schärfer","superlative":"am schärfsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Das Messer ist nicht scharf.","en":"The knife is not sharp.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/469786","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"measurer, surveyor"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Ist es dir scharf genug?","en":"Is it hot enough for you?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},null,{"g":"enough"}]},{"text":"Die Zunge ist schärfer als das Schwert.","en":"The tongue is sharper than the sword.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"tongue"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"sword"}]},{"text":"Du siehst scharf aus.","en":"You look sharp.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/746133","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Dieser Typ ist wirklich scharf.","en":"This guy is really hot.","words":[{"g":"this one, this"},{"g":"type"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"really, actually"},null]}]}